  {"id":221,"x":-80,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Var'Quel Manor, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["The landing is bordered with a brass railing.  A darkly varnished oak door is directly opposite the spiral staircase that leads downstairs.  A porcelain floor vase, standing in the corner, is full of aromatic flowers."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":224,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"},{"to":191,"exit":"climb","move":"climb spiral staircase"}]},
  {"id":222,"x":-80,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Var'Quel Manor, Upstairs Hallway","descriptions":["The corridor is bare of ornamentation except for a small banner embroidered with the crest of House Var'Quel.  A gold framed door and a polished rosewood door stand across from one another at the end of the hall."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":223,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"}]},
  {"id":223,"x":-90,"y":610,"z":0,"title":"Var'Quel Manor, The Red Room","descriptions":["Sanguine walls, hung with rose-colored draperies, blend well with the ruddy silk sheets of the room's bed.  Ceramic vases, standing in the corners, are filled with long stemmed pink carnations."],"exits":[{"to":222,"exit":"go","move":"go rosewood door"}]},
  {"id":224,"x":-90,"y":620,"z":0,"title":"Var'Quel Manor, The Blue Room","descriptions":["A large four posted bed, covered in azure silk sheets, sits in the center of this large bedroom.  The walls are painted a deep blue and hung with dark tapestries.  Fresh flowers are laid out on the bedding, filling the room with a sweet scent."],"exits":[{"to":221,"exit":"go","move":"go oak door"}]},
  {"id":225,"x":60,"y":680,"z":0,"title":"Driftwood Tavern, Storage","descriptions":["Cramped by the low-hanging roof, there is little room to turn around, much less stand upright under the roofbeams.  A dusty barrel and trunk are shoved haphazardly into corners, allowing some movement.  Dust motes hang in the air, slowly drifting to rest on the grimy floor."],"exits":[{"to":183,"exit":"south","move":"south"}]}
 ],
